          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins, and your current Hit Points are at half your maximum or less.</p><hr /><p>Your blood boils when you take a beating, and you throw caution to the wind to finish the fight. You get a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls, a –1 penalty to AC, and a –1 penalty to saves. These bonuses and penalties last until your Rage ends or until you are above half Hit Points, whichever comes first.</p>"
